,"ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.checkWhatTheChatUsed":"Check What the Chat Used","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHood":"Under the Hood","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodTitle":"Under the Hood","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodIntro":"Long-Term Memory has two jobs. It writes durable facts from your sources, then reads the most useful facts back into the chat when they fit.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodExtraction":"Writing to memory (Extraction)","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodSourceNotesLabel":"Source notes.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodSourceNotes":"The original source is kept as a source note. This gives every memory a place to point back to when you want to check where it came from.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodFingerprintsLabel":"Fingerprints.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodFingerprints":"Each source gets a fingerprint made from its content and source details. When the same source is seen again, that fingerprint helps the Engine tell what changed.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodCandidatesLabel":"Candidate memories.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodCandidates":"The extractor turns useful, lasting details into proposed memories. It leaves out passing actions, guesses, and details that are unlikely to matter later.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodEvidenceLabel":"Evidence.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodEvidence":"Every proposal keeps evidence showing which source supported it. Related facts can also point to the event that caused them.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodDuplicatesLabel":"Duplicate checks.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodDuplicates":"Near-duplicates are filtered out before review. One fact should not arrive as several slightly different proposals.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodReviewLabel":"Review.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodReview":"Nothing is written to the Vault automatically. Proposals wait in Review Queue, where you can accept, edit, or skip them.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodRecall":"Reading from memory (Recall)","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodDirectMatchesLabel":"Direct matches.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodDirectMatches":"Direct matches look for known note IDs, source IDs, tags, and other metadata in your message.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodWordMatchingLabel":"Word matching.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodWordMatching":"Word matching checks which memory text shares useful terms with your message.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodKeywordsLabel":"Keywords.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodKeywords":"Keyword matching checks the compact keywords saved with each memory.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodRelatedMemoriesLabel":"Related memories.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodRelatedMemories":"Graph matching follows links from strong matches to related memories.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodMeaningLabel":"Meaning.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodMeaning":"Semantic matching compares meaning when an embedding index is available.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodFusion":"These lanes are fused into one ranking. A relevance threshold removes weak matches, and the token budget limits how much memory can enter the prompt. Higher-priority memories are kept first, and duplicate text is removed.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.underTheHoodCooldown":"The Engine also cools down memories that were recently shown, so the same facts do not crowd out everything else. Sometimes that means a good match waits briefly before appearing again.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.howToRepairVaultHealth":"How to repair vault health","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.continueWithoutAChat":"Continue without a chat","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.continueWithoutActivating":"Continue without activating","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.continueToReview":"Next: Reviewing and saving memories","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.continueToCheck":"Next: Check it works","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.nextUnderTheHood":"Next: Under the Hood","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.conversationPlacementLead":"In Conversation mode, the Engine places recalled memories automatically. No assembly is required.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.conversationPlacementAdvancedBefore":"The","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.conversationPlacementAdvancedBetween":"and","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.conversationPlacementAdvancedAfter":"tags are available for advanced custom placement. Ignore them until you want to control exactly where memories appear.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.goToSavedMemories":"Go to saved memories","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.importACharacter":"Import a character","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.importALorebook":"Import a lorebook","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.inactiveChatStatus":"{{value1}} is currently napping.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.inactiveChatAction":"Nudge it awake with the Active switch up in the header.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.inactiveChatAvailability":"Importing and reviewing keep working even while it dozes.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.inactiveChatVerification":"You cannot verify recall in this chat until it is switched on. Flip it whenever you are ready to test.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.memoryStatesIntro":"You will meet these three words often. Let's get them straight before anything bites.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.sourceNote":"Source note","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.sourceNoteDefinition":"The untouched original. Your character, lorebook, or chat summary is kept under glass as evidence.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.proposedMemory":"Proposed memory","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.proposedMemoryDefinition":"A smaller fact squeezed out of that source and waiting on your desk for review.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.savedMemory":"Saved memory","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.savedMemoryDefinition":"A proposal you accepted. It lives in the Vault.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.recalledMemory":"Recalled memory","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.recalledMemoryDefinition":"A relevant saved memory that the Engine slips into model context for one reply because the conversation matched it.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.recallNotEveryReply":"Saving something does not mean it shows up in every reply.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.recallMatchmaker":"Recall is a matchmaker, not a megaphone.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.nextChooseASource":"Next: Choose a source","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.nextHowRecallWorks":"Next: How recall works","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.nextTurnItOn":"Next: Enabling it for the Current Chat","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.noChatAvailability":"No supported chat open? No drama. You can still import sources and review proposals from right here.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.noChatActivationPath":"When you want to switch recall on later, open a supported chat and go to Chat Settings, then Agents, then Long-Term Memory. It will be waiting.","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.openReviewQueue":"Open Review Queue","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.openChatSummarySettings":"Open Chat Summary settings","ui.longTermMemory.longtermmemorydetail.openPromptPresetSections":"Open Prompt Preset Sections",